<Base title="Syneidesis" lang="en">
    <h1>Welcome to Syneidesis!</h1>

    <article id="caixa1">
        <p>
            On this website, I share my thoughts, experiences, and ideas about
            philosophy and related subjects. I hope you enjoy the content. Happy
            reading!
        </p>
    </article>

    <div class="secao">
        <img src="/imagens/foto.webp" alt="Photo" />

        <div class="texto">
            <h2>Who am I?</h2>
            <p>
                My name is Adham Goulart, and I am a lover of wisdom. One might
                say that I am, above all, a Romantic Hegelian, with a deep
                affinity for and admiration of the Goethezeit, particularly its
                Romantic period. This website is a space where I express my
                sensibility by sharing ideas, references, and personal projects.
                It also serves as a place to preserve and showcase my artistic
                creations.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

